1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,929
THE ABANDONED MILLER HOUSE HAD STOOD EMPTY FOR YEARS.

2
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:07,286
BUT SOMETHING IN ITS BASEMENT DIDN'T BELONG.

3
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:14,468
REED: "WHY WOULD SOMEONE BOLT AN EMPTY SHELF TO THE FLOOR?"

4
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:18,947
MORGAN: "DANIEL... LOOK AT THIS."

5
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:29,011
BEHIND THE SHELVING UNIT WAS A DOOR THAT APPEARED ON NONE OF THE SURVIVING FLOOR PLANS.

6
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,910
MORGAN: "THERE'S ANOTHER ROOM."

7
00:00:45,350 --> 00:00:47,772
REED: "SOMEONE'S BEEN USING THIS PLACE."

8
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:50,890
AND ON THE DESK, THEY FOUND SOMETHING UNEXPECTED.

9
00:00:54,950 --> 00:00:56,632
GIRL'S VOICE: "MOM... IT'S ME."

